      "id": "封面图",
      "title": "封面图",
      "items": [
        {
          "content": "<p>进入四月以后，印度的新冠肺炎患者激增，全国氧气的库存迅速耗尽。政府不得不用气罐车，向重症地区运送液氧。有的地区没有高等级公路，只能将气罐车装在火车上运过去。（<a href=\"https://scroll.in/article/992928/how-grave-is-indias-oxygen-emergency-worse-than-the-government-admits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">via</a>）</p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "via",
              "url": "https://scroll.in/article/992928/how-grave-is-indias-oxygen-emergency-worse-than-the-government-admits"
